#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:1
msgid "4G / CORS 配置"
msgstr "4G / CORS Configuration"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:3
msgid "本页目标"
msgstr "Goal of this page"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:6
msgid ""
"为 **HM-D20-4G 或 HM-D13-4G** 写入 CORS/NTRIP 账号，使设备能够通过蜂窝网络获"
"得差分数据。用户需准备有流量的 SIM 卡、正确账号和蜂窝网络覆盖。"
msgstr ""
"Write the CORS/NTRIP account for **HM-D20-4G or HM-D13-4G** so that the "
"device can receive correction data via the cellular network. Users need to "
"prepare a SIM card with data, the correct account, and cellular network "
"coverage."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:9
msgid "准备工作"
msgstr "Before You Begin"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:11
msgid "HM-D20-4G 或 HM-D13-4G。"
msgstr "HM-D20-4G or HM-D13-4G."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:12
msgid "已开通数据流量的 SIM 卡。"
msgstr "A SIM card with data service activated."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:13
msgid "HM-D20-4G 使用的外置 SMA 4G 天线；HM-D13-4G 的 4G 天线内置。"
msgstr ""
"The HM-D20-4G uses an external SMA 4G antenna; the HM-D13-4G has a built-in "
"4G antenna."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:14
msgid "产品标配的 USB-C 配置线。"
msgstr "The product comes standard with a USB-C configuration cable."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:15
msgid "HM-D20-4G、HM-D13-4G 共用的 JR_NTRIP_Config_Tool_V1.2。"
msgstr "JR_NTRIP_Config_Tool_V1.2 shared by HM-D20-4G and HM-D13-4G."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:16
msgid "CORS/NTRIP 账号信息，包括服务器地址、端口、挂载点、账号和密码。"
msgstr ""
"CORS/NTRIP account information, including server address, port, mount point, "
"account, and password."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:18
msgid "产品差异"
msgstr "Product difference"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:3
msgid "产品"
msgstr "Product"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:3
msgid "4G 天线"
msgstr "4G antenna"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:3
msgid "SIM 卡与配置口"
msgstr "SIM card and configuration port"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:3
msgid "HM-D20-4G"
msgstr "HM-D20-4G"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:3
msgid "外置 SMA 天线"
msgstr "External SMA antenna"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:3
msgid "使用 Nano-SIM 卡；USB-C 配置口位于设备外部"
msgstr ""
"Uses a Nano-SIM card; USB-C configuration port located on the outside of the "
"device"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:3
msgid "HM-D13-4G"
msgstr "HM-D13-4G"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:3
msgid "天线内置"
msgstr "Built-in antenna"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:3
msgid "Nano-SIM 卡槽和 USB-C 配置口位于顶壳内部"
msgstr "The Nano-SIM card slot and USB-C port are located inside the top case."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:25
msgid "配置步骤"
msgstr "Configuration Steps"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:27
msgid "安装 Nano-SIM 卡；HM-D13-4G 卡槽位于顶壳内部。"
msgstr ""
"Install the Nano-SIM card; the HM-D13-4G card slot is located inside the top "
"cover."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:28
msgid "使用 HM-D20-4G 时安装外置 SMA 4G 天线；HM-D13-4G 无需安装外置 4G 天线。"
msgstr ""
"When using HM-D20-4G, install an external SMA 4G antenna; HM-D13-4G does not "
"require the installation of an external 4G antenna."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:29
msgid ""
"使用标配 USB-C 配置线连接 PC 和设备配置口；HM-D13-4G 的配置口位于顶壳内部。"
msgstr ""
"Use the standard USB-C configuration cable to connect the PC and the device "
"configuration port; the configuration port of the HM-D13-4G is located "
"inside the top cover."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:30
msgid ""
"打开 JR_NTRIP_Config_Tool_V1.2。HM-D20-4G 与 HM-D13-4G 使用相同的配置流程。"
msgstr ""
"Open JR_NTRIP_Config_Tool_V1.2. HM-D20-4G and HM-D13-4G use the same "
"configuration process."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:31
msgid "点击 `Auto-Select Target Device` 自动选择配置端口。"
msgstr ""
"Click `Auto-Select Target Device` to automatically select the configuration "
"port."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:32
msgid "点击连接，确认底部日志区域显示连接成功。"
msgstr ""
"Click the connection and confirm that the bottom log area shows the "
"connection was successful."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:33
msgid "在 `NTRIP Server Configuration` 区域填写 CORS/NTRIP 账号信息。"
msgstr ""
"Fill in the CORS/NTRIP account information in the `NTRIP Server "
"Configuration` area."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:34
msgid "点击 `Send Config 1 (Server Settings)` 写入配置。"
msgstr "Click `Send Config 1 (Server Settings)` to write the configuration."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:35
msgid "日志区域返回 `OK` 后，配置完成。"
msgstr "After the log area returns `OK`, the configuration is complete."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:37
msgid "![4G NTRIP 配置](../images/ntrip-config.png)"
msgstr "![4G NTRIP Configuration](../images/ntrip-config.png)"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:37
msgid "4G NTRIP 配置"
msgstr "4G NTRIP Configuration"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:39
msgid "固定解验证"
msgstr "Fixed solution verification"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:41
msgid ""
"完成配置后，按[D20 接口](../operation/d20-wiring.md)或[D13 接口](../"
"operation/d13-wiring.md)连接移动站并上电。"
msgstr ""
"After completing the configuration, connect the rover using the [D20 "
"interface](../operation/d20-wiring.md) or [D13 interface](../operation/d13-"
"wiring.md) and power it on."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:43
msgid ""
"按[RTK 状态与固定解验证](../operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md)检查定位输出和"
"解状态。若无法进入固定解，优先检查 SIM 卡状态、网络覆盖、CORS/NTRIP 账号、4G "
"天线和天空视野。"
msgstr ""
"Follow [Checking RTK Status and the Fixed Solution](../operation/rtk-fixed-"
"validation.md) to verify positioning output and solution status. If the "
"receiver does not reach a fixed solution, check the SIM, cellular coverage, "
"CORS/NTRIP account, 4G antenna, and sky view first."

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:45
msgid "4G 差分配置完成判据"
msgstr "4G correction setup success criteria"

#: ../../source/rtk/differential-links/4g-ntrip.md:48
msgid ""
"配置工具写入返回 `OK`；移动站定位数据持续输出，并在开阔环境进入 **RTK 固定解"
"**。"
msgstr ""
"The configuration tool writes back `OK`; the rover's positioning data is "
"continuously output, and it enters **RTK fixed solution** in open "
"environments."
